{"id":"4f8fbd6e08fa4850","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sld-resolution-step.md","title":"确定程序的标准化 SLD 单步","display":"df-sld-resolution-step — 确定程序的标准化 SLD 单步","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sld-resolution-step","aliases":["72-df-sld-resolution-step"],"display":"df-sld-resolution-step — 确定程序的标准化 SLD 单步","depends_on":["[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","[[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §5.1(R1), print662/PDF674; definite-program restriction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source R1 specialization and freshness conditions checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"逐个对照变量集 Var_S 及 Horn 最小模型 I_omega 的真实上游签名"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sld-resolution-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sld-resolution-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sld-resolution-step — 确定程序的标准化 SLD 单步"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ef46815f85bb26e\" href=\"?note=3ef46815f85bb26e\" title=\"72-lem-program-substitution-composition\">72-lem-program-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §5.1(R1), print662/PDF674; definite-program restriction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source R1 specialization and freshness conditions checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"逐个对照变量集 Var_S 及 Horn 最小模型 I_omega 的真实上游签名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是有限确定程序，体仅含正关系原子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\">\\(G,H\\)</span> 是有限正原子序列。使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ef46815f85bb26e\" href=\"?note=3ef46815f85bb26e\" title=\"72-lem-program-substitution-composition\">72-lem-program-substitution-composition</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 为有限正原子序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为正原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 遍历 V 的有限支持置换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SLD}_P\">\\(\\mathsf{SLD}_P\\)</span> 在下式定义，不预先要求所选原子有解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\theta,H)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists U,V,A,B,K,C,\\rho\\ \\bigl[&amp;G=U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\land C\\in P\\land\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\rho:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\mathrm{Var}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\land C\\rho=\\langle B,K\\rangle\\land\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle B,K\\rangle)\\cap\\operatorname{vars}(G)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{MGUAt}(A,B,\\theta)\\land H=(U^\\frown K^\\frown V)\\theta\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\theta,H)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists U,V,A,B,K,C,\\rho\\ \\bigl[&amp;G=U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\land C\\in P\\land\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\rho:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\mathrm{Var}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\land C\\rho=\\langle B,K\\rangle\\land\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle B,K\\rangle)\\cap\\operatorname{vars}(G)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{MGUAt}(A,B,\\theta)\\land H=(U^\\frown K^\\frown V)\\theta\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>明确先把输入子句改为不与当前 goal 共享变量的变式，再作统一，并将代入作用于替换后的整个 goal。允许选择任一原子；没有把某个固定搜索策略的停机当作完备性。这里仅定义正程序的操作单步，未将其误称原书完整的 SLDNF 成功关系；后者还带 R1 的额外答案变量条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-program-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"3ef46815f85bb26e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ 是有限确定程序，体仅含正关系原子；$G,H$ 是有限正原子序列。使用 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] 和 [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-program-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"3ef46815f85bb26e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ 是有限确定程序，体仅含正关系原子；$G,H$ 是有限正原子序列。使用 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] 和 [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"G,H","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SLD}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\theta,H)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists U,V,A,B,K,C,\\rho\\ \\bigl[&G=U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\land C\\in P\\land\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\rho:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\mathrm{Var}_S\\\\\n&\\land C\\rho=\\langle B,K\\rangle\\land\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle B,K\\rangle)\\cap\\operatorname{vars}(G)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{MGUAt}(A,B,\\theta)\\land H=(U^\\frown K^\\frown V)\\theta\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2204,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-548","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-543","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"98e2eaadb15620c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,G$ 与 $\\mathsf{SLD}_P,\\star,\\varepsilon$ 取 [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]]；$n\\in\\omega$。$\\vec G$ 是长度 n+1 的 goal 序列，$\\vec\\theta$ 是长度 n 的有限支持代入序列。$a_k$ 在下式有限递归；$\\operatorname{Ans}$ 仅在相应长度下定义。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"r